        515,
        167,
        529,
        810
      ],
      "margin_number": 1,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "εἰσπεσόντες Nom. pl. masc. aor. part. of εἰσπίπτω (second aor. ἔπεσον).",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "vocab_entry",
      "order": 11,
      "bbox": [
        534,
        167,
        574,
        889
      ],
      "margin_number": 2,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "αὐτάς ‘them’, see GE p. 153, #172–173. There are other uses and meanings (GE pp. 153–155, #174–176) which will be gradually introduced.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "vocab_entry",
      "order": 12,
      "bbox": [
        577,
        143,
        627,
        908
      ],
      "margin_number": 3,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "2–3 τὰς ἐκ τῆς μάχης περιοούσας περιοούσας agrees with τὰς Ἀμαζόνας and is the acc. pl. fem., participle of περίειμι ‘I survive’. ἔλαβον. λαβόντες δ’ αὐτάς Note the ‘echo’ effect. Cf. 7D lines 17 and 23 and 7F lines 2–3.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "order": 13,
      "bbox": [
        648,
        191,
        663,
        271
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Page 84",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "vocab_entry",
      "order": 14,
      "bbox": [
        671,
        167,
        712,
        876
      ],
      "margin_number": 5,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "ἰδοῦσαι εἶδον (second aorist of ὁράω) drops the augment to give the stem ἰδ-, therefore the participle is ἰδών, ἰδοῦσα, ἰδόν.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "vocab_entry",
      "order": 15,
      "bbox": [
        715,
        167,
        728,
        547
      ],
      "margin_number": 6,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "ἀποκτείνασαι Cf. ἀπέκτειναν line 5.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "vocab_entry",
      "order": 16,
      "bbox": [
        732,
        145,
        765,
        887
      ],
      "margin_number": 9,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "9 ἀφικόμεναι ... ἀποβᾶσαι Remember that the Amazons are feminine. Note: participle ... participle ... main verb.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "vocab_entry",
      "order": 17,
      "bbox": [
        768,
        123,
        836,
        897
      ],
      "margin_number": 12,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "12 Note the structure: οἱ δὲ Σκύθαι / οὐ γιγνώσκοντες τὴν φωνὴν / καὶ ἄνδρας νομίζοντες τὰς Ἀμαζόνας / ἐμπεσόντες καὶ μαχεσάμενοι / τοὺς νεκροὺς ἀνεῖλον (subject / pres. part. / pres. part. / aor. part. and aor. part. / main verb). ἀνελοντες What verb is this from? ἀν-αιρέω, second aorist εἷλον, stem ἑλ-.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "vocab_entry",
      "order": 18,
      "bbox": [
        839,
        157,
        881,
        887
      ],
      "margin_number": 13,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "γόντες From γιγνώσκω, second aorist ἔγνων; the aorist participle is γνοὺς γόντος.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
